    "body": "[ Example ](https://www.dropbox.com/s/i85866m92udfsp7/whatwg-spec.png?dl=0)\n\nSo I've tried:\n- make snippets lighter ( `#f3f3f3` for background and `#fdfdfd` for code sections)\n- choose the particular type of labels (only for languages, such as CSS, IDL etc.)\n\nHowever, current syntax highlighting for Web IDL is still demands rethinking.\n\nWhat are your thoughts on all of this?\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
