    "created_at": "2016-02-05T13:42:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-05T13:42:22Z",
    "body": "What we've done in the past for multipage is uploaded a snapshot spec to a temporary location (html5.org, although we could use html.spec.whatwg.org too). I think it'd be fine to just create /pretty.html that is a copy of index on the server with an additional `<link rel=\"stylesheet\">`.\n\nSlightly related: https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=28555\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
