    "updated_at": "2016-02-05T13:58:05Z",
    "body": "Yes, it would be good to take this opportunity to fix https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=28555\n\nIf anyone wants to experiment with this, @domenic's idea of making a `pretty.html` copy that points to another style sheet sounds good. Just give us a HTTPS URL to point to, maybe a clone of the resources.whatwg.org repo served at github.io would work. We can make `pretty2.html` and `pretty3.html` as well if there are many takers.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
