    "body": "Thanks for great response and it sounds interesting for me to work on it in future.\n\nWhat about details, I added syntax highlighting manually, using current WHATWG styles for it. \nAs for me, paddings and colours need unified general rule for implementing them in stylesheet; for this kind of stuff I should have experimental one. So you give a possibility do that and it is great, indeed\n",
