    "body": "Once https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/634 has been merged, all of the CSS should be either from resources.whatwg.org or inline in the spec, i.e. under version control. To start experimenting, you could simply save the spec and edit it locally, and once you're ready for testing it on the live spec we can set something up.\n",
